  description: '(This card is always treated as a "F.A." card.)

    When this card
    is activated: You can add 1 "U.A." or "F.A." monster from your Deck to your hand,
    OR add 1 "U.A. Stadium" from your GY to your hand. You can reveal 1 Field Spell
    in your hand and pay 1000 LP; you can Normal Summon 1 "U.A." or "F.A." monster
    during your Main Phase this turn, in addition to your Normal Summon/Set. (You
    can only gain this effect once per turn.) You can only activate 1 "U.A. Hyper
    Stadium" per turn.'
